{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謝詞\n不錄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自彰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "湖州知府彭文煒，法名徹崖，號鹿門，沐手拜撰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明恆、明惺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次佛冤兄韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住在鸚鵡山夫子閣朱曙先"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "檀溪監院盛德徒請。"}
